     "The story of Christianity begins in the ancient land of Israel, in the region known in the Roman period as Judea. This land was situated in Western Asia, between the Mediterranean Sea and the territories farther east. It was a place of ancient history, religious expectation, political tension, and cultural diversity.",
     "For generations, the Jewish people had preserved their faith in the one true God. They read the Scriptures, worshipped in synagogues, travelled to Jerusalem for religious festivals, and remembered God’s covenant with their ancestors. Their sacred writings contained promises of a coming Messiah who would bring God’s salvation and establish His kingdom.",
