     "Christian unity requires respect. Shared faith should encourage mutual understanding rather than cultural domination.",
     "Historical identity deserves protection. Ancient communities should not be forced to abandon their heritage without careful consideration.",
     "Mission must be guided by humility. Evangelism should not become a justification for controlling other communities.",
     "Conflict can have lasting consequences. Decisions about leadership and authority may shape churches for generations.",
     "Christians must seek reconciliation. Differences should be addressed through truth, humility, and love."
