     "Historical identity deserves careful protection. Ancient traditions should be understood before changes are introduced.",
     "Mission requires humility. Christian service should not become a means of controlling others.",
     "Conflict can affect generations. Church decisions can have consequences that continue long after the original events.",
     "Reconciliation is part of Christian discipleship. Believers must seek peace without ignoring historical truth."
