     "The distance from Europe was enormous, communication with Rome was difficult, and the cultural environment was unfamiliar.",
     "John had to develop relationships with local people and work within the political structures of the Yuan Dynasty.",
     "His missionary efforts eventually attracted attention from the wider Catholic Church.",
