     "After returning to China in 1927, he began preaching throughout the country and in other parts of Asia. His messages emphasized repentance, salvation through Jesus Christ, the authority of Scripture, and the need for spiritual renewal.",
     "Sung became known for energetic preaching and passionate evangelistic meetings. Many people attended his gatherings, and reports of conversions and renewed Christian commitment spread widely.",
