     "Christianity began establishing a more recognizable presence in Vietnam during the sixteenth and seventeenth centuries.",
     "European maritime expansion had opened new routes connecting Europe, Africa, Asia, and the Americas. Portuguese traders and missionaries became particularly active in Asian coastal regions.",
