     "The story of Quốc Ngữ demonstrates how missionary work can have consequences beyond its original religious purpose.",
     "Although the system developed through the collaboration of multiple people and its later adoption was influenced by colonial and national developments, its history remains closely connected with early Christian linguistic scholarship.",
     "De Rhodes’s legacy is therefore complex. He contributed significantly to Vietnamese language documentation and Catholic mission work, but his missionary activities also took place within the wider context of European religious expansion in Asia.",
