   "Final Prayer",
   "Heavenly Father,",
   "We thank You for the history of Christianity in Myanmar, Thailand, Laos, and Cambodia. We thank You for every missionary, pastor, evangelist, teacher, translator, and believer who helped carry the message of Jesus Christ into these countries.",
   "Thank You for the courage of Adoniram and Ann Judson and for the many local believers who helped translate Scripture, establish churches, and teach future generations. Thank You for the Karen, Chin, Kachin, and other Christian communities whose faith has become an important part of Myanmar’s history.",
   "We thank You for the churches of Thailand, for those who have served through education, medicine, and humanitarian work, and for the believers who have shared their faith with gentleness and respect.",
