   "Lord, we pray for Myanmar and all communities affected by conflict. Protect innocent people, strengthen those who provide humanitarian assistance, and guide leaders toward peace and justice. Remember families who have been displaced and children whose education and security have been disrupted.",
   "We pray for Thailand, Laos, and Cambodia. Bless their people, their leaders, and their communities. May religious differences never become reasons for hatred or violence. Help Christians live peacefully with their Buddhist, Muslim, and other neighbors.",
   "Strengthen churches throughout these countries. Raise up faithful local leaders who understand their languages and cultures. Equip young believers with biblical wisdom and courage. Encourage pastors and teachers who serve in difficult places, and provide resources for congregations working among vulnerable communities.",
