   "May Christian communities be known for their love, integrity, generosity, and compassion. Let their lives reflect the light of Christ in their homes, villages, cities, and nations.",
   "Remind us that Your Church is one body across many countries and cultures. Help us pray for one another, support one another, and remain united in our hope in Jesus Christ.",
   "May the light of the Gospel continue to shine throughout Myanmar, Thailand, Laos, Cambodia, and all the nations of Southeast Asia.",
   "In the mighty and gracious name of Jesus Christ, we pray.",
   "Amen."
