     "Theology begins with Scripture: Christian thinking must remain rooted in the Word of God.",
     "Faith and worship belong together: Hymns, prayers, and spiritual practices can communicate deep theological truths.",
     "Local languages strengthen Christian understanding: Believers should have opportunities to study and express their faith in their own languages.",
     "Wisdom serves the church: Theology should strengthen Christian discipleship rather than become merely an intellectual exercise.",
     "Every Christian tradition can contribute: Asian theological history is an important part of the worldwide Christian heritage."
