     "Interreligious dialogue requires respect: Christians can listen to people of other faiths without hiding their own convictions.",
     "Faith should influence society: Christian belief should encourage justice, compassion, and responsibility.",
     "Theology is enriched by diverse voices: Indian Christian thinkers contributed important perspectives to global Christian discussion."
