     "Revival must lead to discipleship: Spiritual enthusiasm should be accompanied by biblical teaching and transformed lives.",
     "Christian unity requires humility: Believers may disagree about methods and institutions while still seeking faithfulness to Christ.",
     "The church must remain spiritually grounded: Political and social changes should not replace the central message of the Gospel."
