     "She later became a Christian and devoted her life to supporting women, especially widows and girls who were vulnerable to social exclusion and exploitation.",
     "She established the Mukti Mission near Pune, which provided education, shelter, and practical support.",
     "Ramabai’s Christian faith influenced her work, but she also challenged harmful social practices and called for greater dignity and opportunity for women.",
     "Her life became an important example of Christian social leadership in India.",
