     "Mission requires cultural understanding. Syriac Christianity demonstrates the importance of communicating the gospel through languages and traditions people understand.",
     "Christian heritage should be preserved. Manuscripts, worship, history, and spiritual writings help communities remember their identity.",
     "Every generation has a responsibility to pass on the faith. The Church must continue teaching the message of Christ to those who come after it."
