     "The witness of believers can encourage future generations. The memory of the martyrs strengthened Christian communities far beyond Arabia.",
     "Political intervention does not erase the suffering of victims. Historical events must be remembered with compassion and honesty.",
     "The Church must stand with those who suffer. Christians are called to support people who face discrimination, violence, or coercion because of their beliefs."
