   "Father, help Christians throughout the Himalayan region to understand the people around them. Remove pride, prejudice, and misunderstanding from our hearts. Teach us to listen carefully, speak graciously, and serve generously. May our lives demonstrate the compassion and truth of Jesus Christ.",
   "We pray for religious freedom and peaceful relationships in both nations. May people of every faith be treated with fairness and respect. Protect communities from hostility, injustice, and violence. Give political and community leaders wisdom to promote peace and protect the dignity of all citizens.",
