   "Holy Spirit, guide believers as they share the Gospel. Help them communicate Your Word in languages people understand and in ways that respect their communities. Give them courage without arrogance, conviction without hostility, and love without conditions.",
   "May the light of Christ shine through the lives of believers in Nepal and Bhutan. Whether their gatherings are large or small, may they remain faithful to You and serve their neighbours with joy.",
   "We place these Himalayan nations into Your loving hands.",
   "In the mighty name of Jesus Christ, our Lord and Saviour, we pray.",
   "Amen."
