     "Political tolerance can create opportunities for worship. Freedom and protection can help religious communities maintain their institutions.",
     "Access to power is not the same as conversion. Meeting rulers does not guarantee that an empire will accept Christianity.",
     "The Church must remain independent in its spiritual purpose. Christian mission must not become merely a pursuit of political influence.",
